          "why": "Independent command branches for removal and creation."
        }
      ],
      "link_id": "link:987049ad-27aa-4712-9f2e-63be6673c687",
      "reason": "Egg Lay relationship is supported, but the rationale presents removal followed by construction as a single sequence. The two actions have independent command guards and the item is caller-supplied; preserve the link pending rationale correction rather than silently asserting immediate tongue-to-egg conversion."
